        {
          "text": "**Figuring out door mechanics**\n\nI'm analyzing the door hinge axis and realizing it might not be aligned vertically, which affects the panel's initial plane. With the center of mass along the y-axis and considering gravity being zero, it raises some questions about support being unstable. I wonder how raising the panel to contact the floor affects the geometry of the block in front. It has me thinking about the best way to address these issues!",
